# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# First two rules mirror vercel.json redirects (main @ 52e05b3). First match
# wins, so they sit above the SPA catch-all. The catch-all line below is
# unchanged from main: `/* /index.html 200`.
# NOTE: requests handled by Pages Functions skip _redirects, so /api/*
# routes are unaffected by the catch-all.
/ai-tools/claude-code /alternatives/claude-code 301
/privacy-policy /privacy 301
/*    /index.html   200
